    With the above code,test fails because:

    👉 RaceService.get() was mocked using: of(race).pipe(delay(5))

            function mockRaceResource(race: RaceModel) {
                return () => rxResource({ stream: () => of(race).pipe(delay(5)) });
            }

        🔥so the race data was loaded asynchronously.
    

    👉 The test only waited for:

            await vi.advanceTimersByTimeAsync(5);
        
        🔥 "advance/Move the fake clock from 0 ms all the way to 5ms."
        🔥 So This only triggered the RxJS delay(5) timer.
    

    👉 In Angular 22, after the timer completes:
        -> rxResource updates its value.
        -> Signals/computed values are scheduled.
        -> Angular still needs another change detection cycle to update the DOM.
    
    👉 The test checked the DOM too early:

            await expect.element(tester.ponies).toHaveLength(1);

        ⚠️At that moment, the pony hadn't been rendered yet, so the expectation timed out.
        ❌Because no pony was rendered:
            no click occurred,
            onSelection() never ran,
            clickSubject never emitted,
            boost() was never called.


✅ Why this fixed it

        it('should buffer clicks over a second and call the boost method', async () => {
            // omitted
            const tester = new LiveTester(await RouterTestingHarness.create('/races/12/live'));

            await vi.advanceTimersByTimeAsync(50); 👈
            await tester.fixture.whenStable(); 👈
            tester.fixture.detectChanges(); 👈

            await expect.element(tester.ponies).toHaveLength(1);
            // omitted
        });
    
    👉 advanceTimersByTimeAsync(50)
        Gives enough time for the mocked delay(5) timer to complete.

    👉 whenStable()
        Waits for Angular to finish all pending asynchronous work (resources, signals, microtasks,
        etc.).

    👉 detectChanges()
        Forces Angular to update the template with the latest signal/resource values.
    
    👉 After these three steps:
        ✅ rxResource has finished loading.
        ✅ raceModel() has been recomputed.
        ✅ The pony is rendered.
        ✅ The click reaches the component.
        ✅ The boost pipeline executes.
        ✅ The test passes.


